  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for that classic Red Beach lifestyle with size, scope, and unbeatable location to match, this absolute gem on Albatross Road is calling your name!\r\n\r\nSet on an expansive 809m² (more or less) freehold site, this property hits the sweet spot for families, first-home buyers, and savvy investors looking to secure a footprint in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most desirable pockets. Properties offering this incredible balance of land and lifestyle on a full section rarely stay on the market long.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a light-filled open-plan layout connects a sleek, modern kitchen with the dining and living spaces, making everyday living and hosting friends completely effortless. For growing families needing extra space to spread out, the generous second living room offers the perfect retreat - whether configured as a cosy media room, kids' play zone, or dedicated lounge for quiet relaxation. Accommodation is equally well catered for, featuring three double bedrooms serviced by a family bathroom designed for seamless daily living.\r\n\r\nThe indoor-outdoor connection here is second to none. Dual decking options at both the front and rear allow you to follow the sun from your morning coffee right through to evening BBQs. Stepping off the rear deck, you'll discover a sun-drenched, sprawling backyard with lots of room - the ultimate safe haven for kids and pets to run around, kick a ball, and play freely. \r\n\r\nPracticality is also covered with a standalone double garage providing secure parking for your vehicles alongside easy storage for weekend gear. Plus, with generous off-street parking, there’s plenty of extra room to park additional cars, a boat, or extra water toys with total ease.\r\n\r\nLocation truly doesn't get better than this! Leave the car at home and soak up everything Red Beach has to offer. You're within easy walking distance to Red Beach Primary School, in-zone for Orewa College, and just moments from local shops, parks, the scenic estuary walkway, and the golden shores of Red Beach itself.\r\n\r\nYour dream coastal lifestyle starts here - contact us today to arrange a viewing before it’s gone!",
